<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110625" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φηγός</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾱγός</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Theoc.
			9.20
		</span></i>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῦς ἀγρία</span>
			, <i>Valonia oak, Quercus Aegilops,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.8.2
			</span></i>, etc.: freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>(not in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς περικαλλέϊ φηγῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.693
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φηγῷ ἐφ᾽ ὑψηλῆ . . Διός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.60
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ παλαιὰ φ.,</span> of <i>the
				oak</i> of Dodona, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				171
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Frr.</u>
				134.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				212
			</span></i> (but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1168
				</span></i>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>acorn of the same tree,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1137
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				372c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				6.62
			</span></i>. (Cf. Lat. <i>fāgus</i> 'beech', O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>bóc</i> 'beech'.)</div>
